---
import Layout from '../Layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Security & Moderation" showNav={true}>
  <main class="security-page">
    <div class="container security-page__container">
      <section class="security-hero" aria-labelledby="security-title">
        <p class="security-hero__eyebrow">Transparency</p>
        <h1 id="security-title" class="security-hero__title">Security &amp; moderation</h1>
        <p class="security-hero__summary">LabRepo uses a lightweight moderation layer to protect student work, reduce abuse, and keep the platform trustworthy.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="security-grid" aria-label="Moderation details">
        <article class="security-item">
          <h2 class="security-item__title">Why we log activity</h2>
          <p class="security-item__copy">We record key events such as logins, uploads, downloads, and admin actions so we can investigate issues and maintain a secure history.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="security-item">
          <h2 class="security-item__title">What information we collect</h2>
          <p class="security-item__copy">We store metadata such as file names, size, upload time, uploader identity, and basic request details. We do not inspect file contents for moderation.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="security-item">
          <h2 class="security-item__title">Abuse prevention</h2>
          <p class="security-item__copy">We use rate limits, suspicious-activity detection, and admin review tools to reduce spam, storage abuse, and repeated failed login attempts.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="security-item">
          <h2 class="security-item__title">Your privacy</h2>
          <p class="security-item__copy">Private security data is stored server-side and is not sold or used for advertising. We only use it to protect the service and investigate abuse.</p>
        </article>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .security-page {
    padding-block: clamp(36px, 6vw, 72px) clamp(64px, 8vw, 108px);
  }

  .security-page__container {
    width: min(100% - 36px, 1080px);
  }

  .security-hero {
    position: relative;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-divider);
    border-radius: 22px;
    padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 42px);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 92% 0%, rgba(197, 27, 27, 0.19), transparent 45%),
      linear-gradient(155deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.065), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02));
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
  }

  .security-hero__eyebrow {
    color: var(--color-primary-on-dark);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .security-hero__title {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.3vw, 3.2rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1.02;
  }

  .security-hero__summary {
    margin-top: 16px;
    max-width: 66ch;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.4vw, 1.3rem);
    line-height: 1.62;
  }

  .security-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: clamp(18px, 3vw, 28px);
  }

  .security-item {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-divider);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: clamp(18px, 2.8vw, 28px);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    transition: border-color var(--transition-fast), background var(--transition-fast), transform var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .security-item:hover {
    border-color: rgba(255, 113, 113, 0.42);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .security-item__title {
    font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 2.7vw, 2.1rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.028em;
  }

  .security-item__copy {
    margin-top: 12px;
    max-width: 76ch;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.2vw, 1.18rem);
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .security-page__container {
      width: min(100% - 24px, 1080px);
    }

    .security-grid {
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 14px;
    }

    .security-item {
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .security-item__copy {
      line-height: 1.62;
    }
  }
</style>
